# The dev loop's content-addressed cache. Derived data, never committed: every entry recomputes from
# the corpus and the candidate's own source, which is exactly the property PHASE_0_LOOSE_ENDS.md C7
# wishes a committed 1.08 MB measurement cache had.
#
# The rule lives HERE, in a self-ignoring directory, rather than in `research/v3/.gitignore` where the
# embeddings and robustness caches declare theirs. That file had an uncommitted change belonging to
# another workstream when this landed (2026-08-04), and CONVENTIONS.md's explicit-pathspec rule exists
# because two agents in one night swept someone else's parked work into their own commit. Folding
# these two lines in there is a tidy-up for whoever holds that file next; it is not worth a collision.
*
!.gitignore
